{"id":"5fb5c3baa41a46db","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-measure8-ergodic-decomposition.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Ergodic Decomposition","display":"df-zfc-measure8-ergodic-decomposition — ZFC Measure8 Ergodic Decomposition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-ergodic-decomposition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-ergodic-decomposition"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-ergodic-decomposition — ZFC Measure8 Ergodic Decomposition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-integral]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-meas-ergodic-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-ergodic-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-ergodic-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-ergodic-decomposition — ZFC Measure8 Ergodic Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"82c5bdbca91dff27\" href=\"?note=82c5bdbca91dff27\" title=\"58-df-zfc-meas-ergodic-map\">58-df-zfc-meas-ergodic-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,\\mu,T,X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B,e\\in V\">\\(\\eta,\\mu,T,X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B,e\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasErgodicMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasErgodicMap}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ErgodicDecomposition}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ErgodicDecomposition}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}ergodic\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ErgodicDecomposition}_S(\\eta,\\mu,T,X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(T^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=\\mu(A))\\land\\mathcal E=\\{\\nu\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal A}:\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\nu)\\land\\nu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasErgodicMap}_S(T,\\nu,\\mathcal A,X)\\}\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B,\\eta)\\land\\eta(\\mathcal E)=1\\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb R^{\\mathcal E})\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(e(A);\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall\\nu\\in\\mathcal E\\;(e(A)(\\nu)=\\nu(A))\\land\\mu(A)=\\int_{\\mathcal E}e(A)\\,d\\eta\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}ergodic\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ErgodicDecomposition}_S(\\eta,\\mu,T,X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(T^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=\\mu(A))\\land\\mathcal E=\\{\\nu\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal A}:\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\nu)\\land\\nu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasErgodicMap}_S(T,\\nu,\\mathcal A,X)\\}\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B,\\eta)\\land\\eta(\\mathcal E)=1\\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb R^{\\mathcal E})\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(e(A);\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall\\nu\\in\\mathcal E\\;(e(A)(\\nu)=\\nu(A))\\land\\mu(A)=\\int_{\\mathcal E}e(A)\\,d\\eta\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The component measures are probability-valued functions on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>, and the evaluation maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\mapsto\\nu(A)\">\\(\\nu\\mapsto\\nu(A)\\)</span> are explicitly set-coded and measurable before they are integrated.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","em